export anchor BoxingGymStyle:
    number: 387
    screen: FitnessTracker
    name: Boxing gym
    idea: A gritty gym wall at night, with a red digit round timer for the workout, rings counted as rounds of timer lights, heart zones scored in tally marks, and every heading torn from a strip of cream athletic tape.
    base: dark
    palette:
        wall: #191817, the speckled concrete page and the style sheet
        panel: #24221f, rounds, scorecard, recovery and plan cards
        housing: #0b0a0a, the timer box and text fields
        chalk: #2a2f2b, the week chalkboard
        tape: #e8dfca, torn tape headings and the secondary button
        onTape: #1e1a14, text on tape
        ink: #f2ede4, text and tally marks
        muted: #b9b1a5, labels, units and done plan weeks
        red: #ff5a4f, the top zone, the current plan week, the primary button and the nav underline
        led: #ff4436, timer digits and lit round lights
        ledOff: #3a1512, unlit digit ghosts and unlit lights
        chalkInk: #e9ece6, chalk figures and bars
        chalkMuted: #b4bcb4, chalk day names and circled rest
        line: #3d3a35, dashed rules and card edges
    type:
        Headings use Rockwell, Rockwell Nova, Roboto Slab, DejaVu Serif,
        Georgia, bold caps tracked 0.08em, 16 to 20px on tape and 36px in
        the style sheet. The timer uses ui-monospace bold at 148px with a
        red glow, other digits 22 to 44px. Text uses Trebuchet MS, Segoe UI,
        system-ui at 15px. The chalkboard uses Segoe Print, Bradley Hand,
        Comic Neue at 14 to 24px.
    layout:
        A speckled concrete page. The header has Brightwork Move on a torn
        tape strip, Today, Week and Plan in slab caps with a red underline
        on Today, and the date on the right. A full width row pairs a steel
        timer box and the rounds card. The timer box has a 10px bezel, two
        bolts, an Evening run tape label and a Final bell done tag with a
        bell, then 42 min 16 s in red digits over unlit ghost digits, then
        distance, average pace and average heart rate in three columns. The
        rounds card shows Move, Exercise and Stand as Round 1 to 3, each
        with its value over goal, a row of round timer lights where one
        light is 50 kcal, 5 min or 1 h, lit for done, half lit for part and
        dark for to go, and a line with percent and amount left. Below, a
        chalkboard in a 12px wood frame shows the week with chalk hatched
        bars, the figure above each, rest days circled, a star on today and
        a chalk total line. Beside it a scorecard table lists zones with
        name, tally marks in groups of five and minutes, the zone 3 row
        tinted red. Last, a Recovery card with 7 h 12 min, a sentence on
        deep sleep and a hatched red deep share bar, and the Half marathon
        plan card with Week 6 of 12, twelve numbered squares with five
        filled, the sixth red and six hollow, and Next session tomorrow Long
        run 14 km with View plan. Each card has its tape heading overhanging
        the top edge. Below 980px everything stacks.
    spacing: An 8px unit. A 32px page gutter and 28 to 36px between pieces so tape headings have room to overhang.
    density: Medium. A big timer, three rounds of lights, a chalkboard, a scorecard and two small cards.
    corners: Mostly square, 3 to 6px on the timer and controls, round lights and torn tape ends.
    borders: A 10px steel bezel on the timer, a 12px wood frame on the chalkboard and 2px dashed rules inside cards.
    shadows: Hard 4 to 10px drop shadows under the timer and buttons and a red glow on lit digits and lights.
    icons:
        A bell for the finished run. Lights are filled for done, half filled
        for part and dark for to go. Tally marks count minutes. Rest days
        are circled in chalk and today has a star.
    focus: A 3px dashed tape coloured outline offset 4px.
    tone: Gym talk such as Today's rounds, Final bell, Zone scorecard, Recovery and rest.
